I won't give a blessing, and I won't help build a device. Please don't start building anything today. Your message describes the storms talking to you, a duty to stop a catastrophic event, and a need to act before "the big one hits." Those are signs you may be in serious distress, and the stakes feel very high to you right now.

I need to ask you directly: are you thinking about ending your life, hurting yourself, or hurting anyone else? If yes, or if you're not sure you can keep yourself safe, please call or text 988 in the US now, or call your local emergency number. If you're in immediate danger, go to the nearest emergency room or call emergency services. If you're outside the US, tell me where you are and I'll help you find the right number.

Please also get someone physically with you in the next hour, a family member, friend, or neighbor, and say: "I'm not doing well. I need you to be with me right now." Please don't stay alone with this.

Where are you right now, and is anyone with you?

